pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 52, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$kick"
      wrap: false
      text: 02 / 产品 PRODUCT
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 92, 420, 96]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      fontSize: 26
      text: |
        <p>一条已经剪好的 Vlog，</p>
        <p>换一份能执行的补拍清单。</p>
  - elementId: body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 204, 400, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 旭光集把成片按转场切分，逐镜头理解画面，再站在全片上下文里审阅，给出最多 5 条定位建议。每条建议只保留最多两段关键证据，说明改哪里、拍什么、什么景别、几秒、拍到什么程度算通过。
  - elementId: k1-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 344, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: k1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 356, 120, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 镜头级诊断
  - elementId: k1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 380, 120, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$mute"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>按转场切分</p>
        <p>原片时间定位</p>
  - elementId: k-div-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [186, 344, 1, 76]
    viewBox: [1, 76]
    points: "0.5,0 0.5,76"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: k2-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [210, 344, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: k2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [210, 356, 120, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 证据可回看
  - elementId: k2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [210, 380, 120, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$mute"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>每条建议两段证据</p>
        <p>点击即播原片片段</p>
  - elementId: k-div-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [340, 344, 1, 76]
    viewBox: [1, 76]
    points: "0.5,0 0.5,76"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: k3-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [364, 344, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: k3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [364, 356, 126, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 动作可执行
  - elementId: k3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [364, 380, 126, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$mute"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>景别、秒数、插入位置</p>
        <p>与验收条件齐备</p>
  - elementId: shot
    elementType: image
    bounds: [500, 92, 404, 372]
    src: media/ui-projects.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {top: 0, bottom: 0.04, left: 0, right: 0}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: shot-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 470, 404, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 实拍界面 · 项目工作台
  - elementId: foot-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 500, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      wrap: false
      text: 旭光集 LUMENARRATIVE
  - elementId: foot-r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 03 / 12
